@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
hide footbox
actor "Gudang / Admin" as P0
participant "Pemeriksaan GRN" as P1
participant "Express / Admin" as P2
participant "Firestore" as P3
P0 -> P1: Isi GRN, qty dan kondisi
P1 -> P1: Pratinjau hasil pencocokan
P0 -> P1: Simpan penerimaan
P1 -> P2: POST PO/{id}/receipt
P2 -> P2: Verifikasi token dan role
P2 -> P3: Transaksi baca PO terbaru
P3 --> P2: Rincian pesanan
P2 -> P2: Validasi item dan kondisi
P2 -> P3: Simpan GRN dan verifikator
P3 --> P2: Commit berhasil
P2 --> P1: MATCHED / DISCREPANCY
P1 --> P0: Tampilkan status penerimaan
@enduml